  </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #E8E0D4;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--fg,#1A1814);\">1,200+</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7A6E64;\">수강생</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:1px;height:32px;background:#E8E0D4;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--fg,#1A1814);\">4.9</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7A6E64;\">평균 만족도</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:1px;height:32px;background:#E8E0D4;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--fg,#1A1814);\">8주</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7A6E64;\">완성 커리큘럼</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <figure style=\"margin:0;border-radius:var(--radius-card,8px);overflow:hidden;position:relative;\">\n    <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-editorial.svg\" alt=\"Claude 자동화 워크플로우 추상 일러스트\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;display:block;border-radius:var(--radius-card,8px);\" />\n    <figcaption style=\"position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(26,24,20,0.7));padding:24px 20px 20px;\">\n      <blockquote style=\"margin:0;border:none;padding:0;\">\n        <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#F0E9DC;margin:0 0 8px;\">&ldquo;Claude 연동 후 고객 응대 시간이 90% 줄었습니다.&rdquo;</p>\n        <small style=\"font-size:12px;color:#B8A898;\">— 마케팅 컨설턴트, 수강생</small>\n      </blockquote>\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>",
